WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,400
Mo's RV is finally here. I choose the first one.

2
00:00:02,400 --> 00:00:03,840
I've seen Mo's RV before.

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:06,080
It’s just that I didn’t rush to choose because I was interested in other rewards.

4
00:00:06,080 --> 00:00:08,200
The RV comes with ice picks and internal thermostat

5
00:00:08,200 --> 00:00:10,200
Equipped with the features expected of a large RV

6
00:00:10,200 --> 00:00:13,000
With it, I can go out and save those beautiful girls.

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:40,620
People are really not dead. I miss myself too.

8
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:43,520
Lin Dong, I admit that I sent you a breakup message before.

9
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:45,520
This is too much. I'm hungry and cold now.

10
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:48,120
I'm about to die. I just want to see you again before I die.

11
00:00:48,120 --> 00:00:50,320
If I can't see the man I love the most before I die one last time

12
00:00:50,320 --> 00:00:53,260
I don't know why I'm dead

13
00:00:53,260 --> 00:00:56,860
He actually sold it for scrap so little. Why did he want to see me?

14
00:00:56,860 --> 00:01:02,540
He obviously expected me to bring him food and drink. Where are you?
